{"id":"H2518","lemma":"חִלְקִיָּהוּ","transliteration":"chilqiyyah","sayIt":"chil-qiy-yah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hilkiah","meaning":"A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Ki.18.18;\nfather of: Eliakim (H0471)\n§ Hilkiah = \"my portion is Jehovah\"\n1) father of Eliakim, an officer of Hezekiah\n2) high priest in the reign of Josiah\n3) a Merarite Levite, son of Amzi\n4) another Merarite Levite, 2nd son of Hosah\n5) one of those who stood on the right of Ezra when he read the law and probably a Levite and a priest\n6) a priest of Anathoth, father of the prophet Jeremiah\n7) father of Gemariah who was one of Zedekiah's envoys to Babylon","glosses":["hilkiah","then hilkiah’s","so hilkiah","then hilkiah","and"],"count":31,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2ki-18","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hilkiah","kjv":"of Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-18","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hilkiah","kjv":"of Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-18","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Hilkiah’s","kjv":"of Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-22","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hilkiah","kjv":"to Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-22","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Hilkiah","kjv":"And Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-22","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hilkiah","kjv":"Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-22","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hilkiah","kjv":"Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-22","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Hilkiah","kjv":"So Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-23","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hilkiah","kjv":"Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-23","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hilkiah","kjv":"that Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hilkiah","kjv":"Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":45,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hilkiah","kjv":"of Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hilkiah","kjv":"of Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hilkiah","kjv":"Hilkiah"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-34","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hilkiah","kjv":"to Hilkiah"